---
// Vercel Web Analytics, on every page of the site. Since v1.8.0 that includes the dashboard
// at `/`, which is an Astro page like any other and picks this up through BaseLayout.astro
// rather than carrying its own copy of the script.
// Until Sep 2026 the content pages only carried Speed Insights — which was canceled on the
// project in Jul 2026 — so every page but the dashboard was invisible in Web Analytics
// (the requestPath breakdown showed "/" alone).
// `is:inline` keeps Astro from bundling it; the script is served by Vercel per deployment.
// CSP: script-src allows https://va.vercel-scripts.com (vercel.json).
---
<script is:inline defer src="/_vercel/insights/script.js"></script>
